-- CAPEX-PAGE-MEASURES (bim-ootb prompts/CAPEX_DASHBOARD.md §5.66 PR B): the measures the dashboard page still computed in capex/tiles.js, as iDempiere Performance Analysis rows. Same convention as 202611111310_CAPEX-PROPOSED-MEASURES.sql.
-- Money rows are ONE row for every currency: they filter on C_Currency_ID=@$C_Currency_ID@, the login's accounting-schema currency on legacy (Login.java:569, parsed by MMeasureCalc.getSqlPI :183-184); the page evaluates them once per currency present (§5.66 D3).
-- Ratio and forecast rows end in ROUND(..., 6): legacy numeric division stores ~20 digits, the twin's SQLite REAL cannot; both sides store the same 6 places (§5.66 PR B result).
-- The released per-currency USD/BDT rows (1000014-1000020, 1000035-1000036, 1000040-1000042) are NOT changed. Ids 1000070-1000088, born EntityType 'A' (§5.57). Names ending '(proposed)' await the client (§6 Q3/Q4, §5.51).
-- Restore: DELETE FROM PA_Goal WHERE PA_Measure_ID BETWEEN 1000070 AND 1000088; DELETE FROM PA_Measure WHERE PA_Measure_ID BETWEEN 1000070 AND 1000088; DELETE FROM PA_MeasureCalc WHERE PA_MeasureCalc_ID BETWEEN 1000070 AND 1000088;
SELECT register_migration_script('202611131300_CAPEX-PAGE-MEASURES.sql') FROM dual;

